# ONE CONCEPT: a value-type slot on the drake surface parses to a TYPE-FORM TREE in the agreed encoding
# (TypeForm's doc; drake.dlt VALUE-TYPES): Atomic = string leaf, Objective = {"(,)": [...]}, Parametric =
# {"()": [F, A...]} with [T] / {T} / {K, V} as Seq / Set / Map, Morphic = {"->": [S, T]} binary and
# RIGHT-associative (Haskell's — confirmed with Dev 2026-09-16 after the 09-13 example had the grouping
